  description: A dark shrine with a violet gem where a heart should be. Whatever
    is sealed inside was sealed for a reason - and your bullets are a key.
  tactics: 'CURSED miniboss: a 30-HP walking shrine whose death makes you LEADEN
    (slow) for four seconds. It blocks like an Aegis, so the temptation to break
    it is constant - but time your kill for a calm moment, or dodge around it and
    leave the seal alone. The aura pulse marks the price.'
